WEBVTT

01:31.640 --> 01:32.700
=The Road to Splendor=

01:32.700 --> 01:34.760
(Adapted from China Literature author
Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

01:35.160 --> 01:38.000
=Episode 33=

01:54.440 --> 01:56.000
There is no need for pleasantries
between us.

01:56.680 --> 01:58.680
In a way, this misfortune has turned
into a blessing for you.

02:00.079 --> 02:01.799
At least, you no longer
have me as a rival.

02:02.000 --> 02:03.920
You've repeatedly made insinuations

02:03.920 --> 02:05.159
about my background.

02:05.879 --> 02:07.000
But do you know

02:07.359 --> 02:08.919
what trained courtesans
like me truly went through?

02:12.120 --> 02:13.919
There were five other girls

02:15.240 --> 02:16.280
bought into the household with me.

02:17.120 --> 02:18.520
When I was eight or nine,

02:19.039 --> 02:20.039
one of them

02:20.199 --> 02:21.560
was sold off as a servant

02:22.400 --> 02:23.759
because she wasn't pretty enough.

02:24.560 --> 02:26.360
Another girl was trained in dancing,

02:26.919 --> 02:28.479
but starvation ruined her health.

02:28.639 --> 02:29.680
She never reached adulthood.

02:30.919 --> 02:31.960
And another

02:32.520 --> 02:34.120
was abused by the family
she was sent to,

02:34.599 --> 02:35.960
and died after a miscarriage.

02:39.120 --> 02:39.919
Madam,

02:40.439 --> 02:42.560
you are not truly a wicked person.

02:43.360 --> 02:45.280
You only wanted to earn
everyone's respect.

02:46.599 --> 02:47.479
So,

02:48.599 --> 02:49.639
in your eyes,

02:49.639 --> 02:50.759
the cruelest things

02:50.919 --> 02:52.479
were nothing more than

02:53.000 --> 02:55.039
petty tricks meant to embarrass others.

02:58.759 --> 03:00.240
Compared with the other girls,

03:01.759 --> 03:03.120
I was already one of the lucky ones.

03:05.560 --> 03:06.439
Miss Fan,

03:09.240 --> 03:10.039
on your journey,

03:11.639 --> 03:12.680
please take care of yourself.

03:13.919 --> 03:15.439
And I hope that one day

03:16.800 --> 03:18.479
you can break free
from this confined world.

03:27.039 --> 03:28.520
(No wonder Madam Zhao said)

03:29.039 --> 03:31.000
(who you are born as may matter,)

03:32.000 --> 03:33.919
(and who you marry may matter too,)

03:35.280 --> 03:36.560
(but what matters most)

03:37.759 --> 03:39.479
(is who you ultimately become.)

03:41.680 --> 03:42.800
(I hope we)

03:44.479 --> 03:45.719
(can all find freedom someday.)

04:04.159 --> 04:04.960
Madam,

04:05.800 --> 04:08.240
the Young Madam Yu didn't take any gold
or jewelry with her.

04:09.319 --> 04:11.919
She only took the ten chests
of manuscripts she brought as dowry.

04:12.400 --> 04:13.560
Perhaps...

04:14.520 --> 04:15.840
she finally understood.

04:17.199 --> 04:18.519
From beginning to end,

04:19.639 --> 04:22.000
all she wanted was for others
to respect her.

04:22.360 --> 04:24.879
She never cared about gold and silver.

04:27.480 --> 04:29.439
The Yu family could never hold her back.

04:29.519 --> 04:31.240
Since she wants freedom,

04:32.240 --> 04:33.519
let her go.

04:41.800 --> 04:42.560
Cairong,

04:43.040 --> 04:45.120
sell all the gold jewelry I've saved.

04:45.399 --> 04:46.639
Exchange them all for silver notes.

04:47.879 --> 04:48.720
Why?

04:49.000 --> 04:51.079
Those are your dignity
when you leave the house.

04:51.360 --> 04:52.199
Don't be foolish.

04:53.560 --> 04:54.639
Today it is her.

04:55.560 --> 04:56.560
But who knows...

04:56.959 --> 04:58.240
tomorrow it won't be me?

05:00.079 --> 05:01.519
Keep only gold-plated pieces

05:02.040 --> 05:03.360
for appearances.

05:03.920 --> 05:05.519
When a real crisis comes,

05:05.759 --> 05:06.720
those ornaments

05:06.720 --> 05:07.639
won't save my life.

05:08.120 --> 05:09.360
Only those silver notes

05:09.480 --> 05:11.240
are a true lifeline.

05:22.959 --> 05:23.680
Grand Secretary Tian,

05:24.439 --> 05:25.360
I hope you'll forgive my boldness,

05:26.120 --> 05:27.879
but before you retire,

05:28.120 --> 05:29.360
I'd like to ask you
to submit a memorial.

05:30.399 --> 05:31.480
Commander Zhao,

05:31.480 --> 05:32.399
I,

05:33.240 --> 05:35.000
after serving in office for decades,

05:35.480 --> 05:37.680
have survived by knowing
when to stay out of trouble.

05:37.680 --> 05:38.639
Those words have been my rule.

05:39.199 --> 05:40.839
This mess you're stepping into,

05:40.839 --> 05:42.399
I won't get involved.

05:44.759 --> 05:45.920
The old salt administration case

05:46.519 --> 05:47.439
does have suspicious circumstances.

05:48.800 --> 05:50.519
The evidence points directly
to the Yu family.

05:51.079 --> 05:52.040
If you were to speak,

05:52.319 --> 05:53.519
instead of someone like me,

05:54.680 --> 05:57.120
the difference in influence
would be immeasurable.

05:58.199 --> 06:00.240
All I ask is that you submit
one memorial on my behalf.

06:00.240 --> 06:01.879
I'll handle

06:02.560 --> 06:03.439
the dirty work and the hard work
that follows.

06:03.839 --> 06:05.199
It will root out corruption

06:05.839 --> 06:07.319
and replenish the imperial treasury.

06:08.279 --> 06:09.399
It will benefit both the court
and the people.

06:11.720 --> 06:12.360
Of course,

06:12.879 --> 06:13.920
I

06:16.319 --> 06:17.439
do have my own motives.

06:18.639 --> 06:19.959
But for you, Master Tian,

06:20.879 --> 06:22.399
this would also allow your name

06:23.600 --> 06:25.600
to leave a distinguished mark
in history.

06:28.920 --> 06:30.800
Commander Zhao, let me tell you,

06:31.079 --> 06:34.360
I'm 58 years old.

06:34.680 --> 06:36.079
In just a few years,

06:36.240 --> 06:38.759
I'll be heading home to retire.

06:39.040 --> 06:39.800
And you're here

06:40.000 --> 06:41.759
trying to sell me a dream?

06:46.399 --> 06:48.160
In this life,

06:48.279 --> 06:49.800
the more one craves,

06:49.800 --> 06:51.680
the harder the fall when it's lost.

06:51.959 --> 06:53.680
Power,

06:53.800 --> 06:54.839
you may seek it,

06:55.480 --> 06:56.879
but never cling to it.

06:57.800 --> 06:59.240
As for me,

06:59.399 --> 07:00.639
I have enough.

07:08.160 --> 07:08.920
Well,

07:08.920 --> 07:10.720
I'm afraid I'm rather tired.

07:10.720 --> 07:12.920
I won't keep you any longer,
Commander Zhao.

07:13.040 --> 07:14.240
Young man,

07:14.399 --> 07:15.759
you should be on your way.

07:35.120 --> 07:36.000
How did it go?

07:36.879 --> 07:37.920
He doesn't crave power.

07:38.560 --> 07:39.439
He doesn't seek wealth.

07:40.399 --> 07:42.399
Even the chance to be remembered
in history couldn't move him.

07:44.600 --> 07:46.199
For now, I truly can't find

07:46.199 --> 07:47.600
anything that would persuade him.

07:49.759 --> 07:51.480
Even the Buddha

07:52.600 --> 07:54.279
sought to save all sentient beings.

07:56.040 --> 07:57.560
I refuse to believe that in this world

07:58.199 --> 07:59.120
there is truly someone

07:59.120 --> 08:00.319
who has completely severed all desires.

08:02.160 --> 08:03.759
The Tian family...

08:05.759 --> 08:07.240
what is it they truly seek?

08:08.920 --> 08:10.720
Grand Secretary Tian
has retired from office.

08:11.399 --> 08:12.759
As for Madam Yu's generation,

08:13.040 --> 08:14.399
they have little left to worry about.

08:15.000 --> 08:15.879
But

08:16.160 --> 08:17.800
what about when their eldest daughter
comes of age?

08:18.680 --> 08:20.600
Women cannot take the examinations
or enter government service.

08:21.000 --> 08:23.240
You certainly wouldn't want her confined
to the inner chambers.

08:24.000 --> 08:25.439
Nor would you bear to see her

08:25.439 --> 08:27.279
spend her life tending to her in-laws
and household chores.

08:28.120 --> 08:29.279
Then in the future,

08:29.279 --> 08:30.399
what path will she have?

08:31.759 --> 08:32.919
How do you know

08:33.200 --> 08:35.320
I haven't planned for her future?

08:36.039 --> 08:37.639
Madam comes from a distinguished family.

08:37.879 --> 08:39.159
You do not chase power,

08:39.360 --> 08:40.519
nor covet wealth,

08:41.159 --> 08:42.879
yet patiently

08:42.879 --> 08:44.519
organize this gathering every month.

08:45.440 --> 08:46.320
I believe

08:47.200 --> 08:48.559
it is probably to

08:48.720 --> 08:50.200
pave the way for your daughter.

08:50.799 --> 08:52.759
So that the connections

08:52.759 --> 08:53.480
and resources

08:53.480 --> 08:54.440
you have built can be passed on to her.

08:57.159 --> 08:59.679
If I could invite Grand Empress Dowager
to attend in person,

08:59.960 --> 09:01.519
then Madam's gathering

09:01.639 --> 09:02.960
would gain even greater prestige.

09:03.679 --> 09:05.279
And the reputation passed
on to your daughter

09:05.559 --> 09:06.559
would be all the more elevated.

09:09.879 --> 09:11.320
Can you truly make that happen?

09:11.919 --> 09:12.840
I

09:12.960 --> 09:14.159
will do my best to try.

09:23.519 --> 09:25.720
I recently came across
an extraordinary book,

09:26.879 --> 09:29.120
and have brought it here
for Your Majesty's appreciation.

09:30.560 --> 09:31.600
(Dongshan Poetry Talks)

09:32.759 --> 09:33.679
This book

09:33.799 --> 09:36.039
was compiled by the renowned
scholar Fan Kun

09:36.039 --> 09:36.840
and is titled

09:36.840 --> 09:37.960
Dongshan Poetry Talks.

09:41.039 --> 09:43.399
The binding is quite elegant.

09:43.759 --> 09:45.279
What makes this book remarkable

09:45.360 --> 09:46.279
is that

09:46.759 --> 09:48.159
it contains commentary
from both father and daughter.

09:50.320 --> 09:51.480
The notes in black on the left

09:51.600 --> 09:52.919
were written by Fan Kun.

09:53.440 --> 09:54.759
The notes in red on the right

09:54.919 --> 09:56.679
are the insights of Fan Yake.

09:57.960 --> 09:59.120
I happened to obtain this book

09:59.120 --> 10:01.399
at Madam Wei's literary gathering.

10:02.000 --> 10:03.360
After reading it carefully,

10:03.360 --> 10:04.399
I found it truly remarkable.

10:04.600 --> 10:05.159
Therefore,

10:05.320 --> 10:06.960
I present it to Your Majesty.

10:07.399 --> 10:08.840
Compared with her father,

10:09.200 --> 10:10.480
I find that

10:10.720 --> 10:12.320
the daughter's perspectives

10:12.320 --> 10:14.320
are much more to my liking.

10:14.799 --> 10:17.159
For a woman to possess such talent

10:17.519 --> 10:18.720
is truly rare.

10:20.200 --> 10:21.799
If Your Majesty

10:21.799 --> 10:23.600
would be willing to bring
the court ladies with you

10:23.600 --> 10:25.399
and attend the literary gathering
in the capital,

10:26.039 --> 10:27.320
and have this grand occasion

10:27.320 --> 10:28.559
recorded in the Imperial Daily Records,

10:29.600 --> 10:31.559
it would encourage women
to pursue learning

10:31.840 --> 10:34.200
and add another distinguished chapter
to Your Majesty's legacy.

10:35.039 --> 10:36.039
Would that not be

10:37.080 --> 10:38.200
a wonderful thing?

10:43.679 --> 10:44.720
Excellent.

10:49.759 --> 10:50.879
I've heard that

10:50.960 --> 10:52.679
women in the Northwest

10:53.200 --> 10:54.279
can both

10:54.279 --> 10:55.840
ride horses and shoot arrows,

10:56.360 --> 10:57.120
and also

10:57.120 --> 10:58.720
work the fields

10:58.879 --> 11:00.320
and prepare supplies for the army.

11:01.559 --> 11:02.960
The capital

11:03.480 --> 11:05.440
may not have the vast beauty
of the Gobi Desert,

11:06.240 --> 11:09.039
but it has its own elegance
and refinement.

11:09.799 --> 11:12.000
I came out of the palace today

11:12.720 --> 11:14.559
because I wanted to see

11:15.720 --> 11:17.759
how the young ladies of the capital

11:18.159 --> 11:19.440
usually

11:20.080 --> 11:22.639
spend their time.

11:22.879 --> 11:25.440
Greetings, Your Majesty.

11:26.279 --> 11:27.440
Rise.

11:27.759 --> 11:30.080
Thank you, Your Majesty.

11:31.679 --> 11:33.000
Your Majesty,

11:33.799 --> 11:34.720
the capital

11:34.720 --> 11:36.360
is a place where culture flourishes.

11:36.639 --> 11:38.039
The ladies here

11:38.240 --> 11:39.600
may not be skilled at riding horses

11:39.600 --> 11:40.399
or archery,

11:40.679 --> 11:42.799
but they often compose poetry and paint,

11:43.000 --> 11:44.080
host literary gatherings,

11:44.240 --> 11:45.320
and form poetry societies.

11:45.840 --> 11:47.000
So,

11:47.519 --> 11:48.679
is this

11:48.799 --> 11:50.720
the gathering you host?

11:52.279 --> 11:53.519
Your Majesty,

11:54.320 --> 11:55.159
I merely

11:55.159 --> 11:56.840
provide a place for everyone to gather.

11:56.840 --> 11:58.840
It is only thanks to the support
and kindness of the ladies here.

12:02.360 --> 12:03.679
Very good.

12:03.919 --> 12:05.279
Very good indeed.

12:07.519 --> 12:09.600
Come, show me around the rest
of the place.

12:10.200 --> 12:11.279
This way, Your Majesty.

12:12.799 --> 12:14.279
(Spring, the 7th year of Hongzhi.)

12:14.519 --> 12:17.679
(Grand Empress Dowager left the palace
to attend Madam Wei's gathering.)

12:17.879 --> 12:18.759
(She was greatly pleased)

12:18.919 --> 12:20.360
(and praised the event.)

12:20.639 --> 12:22.240
Even the Grand Empress Dowager
came in person.

12:22.440 --> 12:24.039
Madam Wei certainly
has quite a reputation.

12:24.120 --> 12:26.159
Madam Zhao truly knows
how to make things happen.

12:26.639 --> 12:27.519
Rest assured.

12:27.720 --> 12:29.279
Whatever Commander Zhao plans to do,

12:29.480 --> 12:31.519
I'll persuade my father to step forward.

12:38.400 --> 12:41.400
(Xie Jewelry Shop)

12:49.120 --> 12:50.039
This pearl

12:50.120 --> 12:51.320
is of excellent quality.

12:51.519 --> 12:52.480
Its estimated value

12:52.720 --> 12:54.039
is around ten thousand taels each.

12:54.639 --> 12:55.879
Ten thousand taels?

12:55.879 --> 12:57.240
It truly is a priceless treasure.

12:57.799 --> 12:59.279
Such a rare find.

12:59.559 --> 13:02.240
Who could afford to buy
it at that price?

13:02.360 --> 13:03.519
However, if

13:03.720 --> 13:05.279
we could find another pearl

13:05.279 --> 13:06.519
of the same quality

13:06.639 --> 13:07.639
to make a matching pair,

13:08.120 --> 13:09.320
its value

13:09.720 --> 13:11.399
would increase by at least three times.

13:12.240 --> 13:14.159
Three times?

13:14.600 --> 13:17.159
So if anyone's household
has a similar pearl,

13:17.360 --> 13:20.039
Xie Jewelry Shop is willing to buy it
for twice the market price.

13:21.039 --> 13:22.480
Three times the value...

13:22.480 --> 13:23.919
(Yu)
So beautiful.

13:24.480 --> 13:25.039
This...

13:25.279 --> 13:26.559
Isn't this the box

13:26.559 --> 13:27.919
Grand Secretary Yu sent over

13:27.919 --> 13:29.080
when he came to apologize last time?

13:29.399 --> 13:30.399
Could it be

13:30.399 --> 13:32.679
that Grand Secretary Yu gave it
to the owner of Xie Jewelry Shop?

13:33.320 --> 13:35.440
Grand Secretary Yu has always
prided himself on his integrity.

13:35.559 --> 13:36.759
Who would have thought that
when he makes a gift,

13:36.759 --> 13:38.360
he would offer something so valuable.

13:38.679 --> 13:39.720
Indeed.

13:40.440 --> 13:42.000
(Yu Residence)

13:42.000 --> 13:43.799
If we go out now and say it wasn't
from us,

13:43.799 --> 13:44.960
no one will believe us.

13:45.039 --> 13:46.519
The whole capital is already
talking about it.

13:46.759 --> 13:47.960
They say the Yu family
is immensely wealthy,

13:48.039 --> 13:49.759
and that we give extravagant gifts.

13:50.279 --> 13:51.360
That woman Fu...

13:51.360 --> 13:52.480
she turned a fake performance
into reality.

13:52.679 --> 13:54.120
That was truly a vicious move.

13:54.720 --> 13:56.120
She never once said

13:56.120 --> 13:57.480
that it was a gift from the Yu family.

13:57.960 --> 14:00.279
Yet she let the rumors spread
through the streets.

14:00.279 --> 14:02.679
Now we can't even explain ourselves.

14:02.679 --> 14:04.399
She used the gift I gave
to build her own reputation,

14:04.399 --> 14:05.639
and turned it into a weapon against us.

14:05.879 --> 14:07.120
This isn't a counterattack.

14:07.480 --> 14:08.399
It's a provocation.

14:11.320 --> 14:12.840
I warned you long ago

14:13.080 --> 14:14.639
not to send an empty box.

14:17.960 --> 14:20.279
This is not the time for such remarks.

14:20.279 --> 14:21.120
Madam.

14:21.399 --> 14:23.799
The entire capital is watching
the Yu family now.

14:23.919 --> 14:25.399
Everyone is saying how wealthy we are.

14:25.519 --> 14:26.519
Under normal circumstances,

14:26.799 --> 14:29.639
His Majesty would
simply turn a blind eye.

14:29.639 --> 14:31.279
But the court is in desperate
need of funds right now.

14:31.399 --> 14:32.519
What Fu did

14:33.159 --> 14:34.480
was to put the Yu family

14:34.480 --> 14:35.759
right in the line of fire.

14:36.759 --> 14:37.759
And Zhao Ling...

14:38.120 --> 14:40.159
I don't know what tricks he pulled,

14:40.159 --> 14:41.519
but he managed to persuade Tian.

14:41.720 --> 14:44.039
He could have simply retired
with dignity.

14:44.039 --> 14:45.039
But right before leaving,

14:45.039 --> 14:46.279
he submitted a memorial and set me up.

14:46.279 --> 14:47.360
He wants to establish some kind of

14:47.360 --> 14:48.480
Salt Tax Office.

14:48.840 --> 14:50.279
The handover alone
will take half a year.

14:50.480 --> 14:51.159
By then,

14:51.159 --> 14:52.200
that old fox

14:52.200 --> 14:53.519
will be back in the countryside fishing!

14:55.399 --> 14:57.080
I heard Grand Secretary Tian

14:57.080 --> 14:58.639
specifically included in the regulations

14:58.639 --> 14:59.759
that officials from the Six Ministries
be assigned.

15:00.960 --> 15:03.159
He's trying to remove all our people.

15:03.440 --> 15:05.080
Exactly, Madam.

15:05.960 --> 15:07.519
Don't blame me for being anxious.

15:08.279 --> 15:10.440
Once the salt accounts are handed over,

15:11.120 --> 15:12.840
the things we've been hiding...

15:15.720 --> 15:16.320
Anyway,

15:16.600 --> 15:17.879
those dirty accounts...

15:18.080 --> 15:20.120
Zhao Ling is determined to dig them up.

15:20.360 --> 15:21.440
And now the woman Fu

15:21.440 --> 15:22.080
has given us

15:22.480 --> 15:23.080
another

15:23.080 --> 15:24.200
mess to deal with.

15:30.200 --> 15:32.399
(Hold Fast to the Mean)
I have reviewed the salt regulations

15:32.399 --> 15:33.200
drafted by Tian.

15:33.320 --> 15:34.159
Very good.

15:34.840 --> 15:36.200
The key point

15:36.200 --> 15:38.320
lies in the appointment
of the Salt Tax Office officials.

15:41.600 --> 15:42.240
Your Majesty,

15:43.120 --> 15:44.159
I humbly offer

15:44.159 --> 15:44.919
myself for the position

15:45.960 --> 15:47.159
to oversee this matter.

15:50.919 --> 15:52.759
There have been some rumors
in the capital recently.

15:53.000 --> 15:54.279
I have heard about them as well.

15:54.960 --> 15:57.240
Minister Yu, perhaps you should
settle your own accounts first

15:57.240 --> 15:58.960
before concerning yourself
with the salt administration accounts.

16:01.320 --> 16:03.039
This matter will be handled
by Minister Zhao.

16:04.840 --> 16:06.240
I obey.

16:10.159 --> 16:11.159
In this world,

16:11.159 --> 16:13.320
the easiest thing to manipulate
is the human heart.

16:13.600 --> 16:16.399
Fu Tingyun wants to make the Yu family
the target of everyone's anger.

16:17.279 --> 16:20.200
Zhao Ling wants to place his own people
in the Salt Tax Office.

16:22.720 --> 16:24.639
Then perhaps we should make a move
of our own.

16:27.600 --> 16:29.039
Cut off the problem at its root.

16:43.720 --> 16:44.658
(Yan Merchant Guild)

16:44.659 --> 16:45.440
(Hall of Worthy Gatherings)

16:45.440 --> 16:46.159
Mr. Jin,

16:46.279 --> 16:48.440
if the court really establishes
the Salt Tax Office,

16:48.440 --> 16:49.600
then in the future, salt permits

16:49.600 --> 16:50.480
will have to be purchased with money

16:50.480 --> 16:51.919
directly from the Ministry of Revenue.

16:51.919 --> 16:54.320
Won't that mean we'll need even
stronger connections to survive?

16:54.320 --> 16:56.120
But we have Mr. Jin.

16:57.480 --> 16:58.240
Mr. Jin,

16:58.360 --> 16:59.559
give us a hint.

16:59.720 --> 17:01.399
Will our future backer

17:01.600 --> 17:03.120
still be Zhao?

17:03.120 --> 17:04.839
Commander Zhao has already
risen in rank.

17:04.839 --> 17:06.720
He is now a third rank official.

17:06.720 --> 17:07.519
Mr. Jin,

17:07.799 --> 17:09.799
are you sure you still

17:09.799 --> 17:11.000
have influence with Commander Zhao?

17:11.000 --> 17:12.480
Mr. Jin, just give us a straight answer.

17:12.480 --> 17:14.400
Can we still stay in the salt business?

17:14.400 --> 17:15.359
Yes, Mr. Jin.

17:15.359 --> 17:17.279
Our families and dozens of workers

17:17.279 --> 17:18.319
all depend on this for a living.

17:18.319 --> 17:19.319
Mr. Jin!

17:19.480 --> 17:21.480
Mr. Jin! Mr. Jin!

17:21.599 --> 17:22.599
A distinguished guest

17:22.599 --> 17:24.319
has invited you to Qingfeng Teahouse.

17:41.440 --> 17:42.960
I, Jin Yuanbao, a humble commoner,

17:43.559 --> 17:44.720
and I pay my respects to Madam Yu.

17:52.759 --> 17:53.559
I never expected

17:53.880 --> 17:55.400
Grand Secretary Yu himself would come.

17:56.200 --> 17:57.400
I am deeply honored!

17:59.000 --> 18:00.880
Mr. Jin, no need for formalities.

18:00.880 --> 18:02.279
Please, rise.

18:03.720 --> 18:04.519
Have a seat.

18:04.720 --> 18:05.240
My Lord.

18:05.440 --> 18:06.440
Have a seat.

18:09.759 --> 18:11.279
I invited you here today

18:11.519 --> 18:13.200
because I have a good opportunity
for you.

18:14.559 --> 18:15.759
As you know,

18:15.839 --> 18:16.880
since the establishment

18:16.880 --> 18:18.240
of the Salt Tax Office,

18:18.839 --> 18:20.359
all salt permits across the realm

18:21.079 --> 18:23.359
must now be obtained by paying silver.

18:25.960 --> 18:28.359
If Mr. Jin is willing to testify

18:29.319 --> 18:32.359
and expose Zhao Ling's past involvement
in private salt trading,

18:32.720 --> 18:34.559
and reveal how he colluded
with merchants

18:35.119 --> 18:37.599
and exploited salt merchants,

18:37.960 --> 18:39.440
I guarantee

18:40.839 --> 18:42.759
all salt permits in the entire Northwest

18:43.640 --> 18:45.880
every share of the salt quota

18:45.880 --> 18:47.519
will belong to you, Mr. Jin.

18:47.680 --> 18:49.000
From this day forward,

18:49.720 --> 18:52.640
you will become the biggest
salt merchant in the Northwest.

18:55.039 --> 18:55.920
My Lord.

18:56.200 --> 18:57.039
This... this...

18:57.519 --> 18:59.200
This cannot be done.

19:00.599 --> 19:02.359
This would be a false accusation.

19:03.200 --> 19:04.279
Falsely accusing a court official

19:04.279 --> 19:05.839
will get me a beating.

19:06.000 --> 19:06.720
And besides,

19:06.839 --> 19:08.319
if the charge is official-merchant
collusion,

19:08.319 --> 19:10.519
the merchant involved
will be punished as well.

19:10.839 --> 19:11.519
Impossible.

19:11.519 --> 19:12.519
Back in those days,

19:12.680 --> 19:14.759
you did business with Zhao Ling.

19:15.079 --> 19:17.799
You must have seen the Zhao family's
land deeds and property records.

19:18.279 --> 19:20.119
You must have seen his personal seal
as well.

19:20.720 --> 19:22.160
Those will serve as evidence.

19:22.640 --> 19:23.920
They will turn this case

19:24.119 --> 19:25.400
into an airtight case.

19:26.200 --> 19:27.640
Then it won't be a false
accusation anymore.

19:27.839 --> 19:28.599
Second,

19:29.119 --> 19:30.960
you won't have to bear
the risk yourself.

19:30.960 --> 19:33.359
Pick someone among your business
associates

19:33.880 --> 19:35.279
and let him take the blame.

19:38.680 --> 19:39.480
Madam.

19:39.880 --> 19:40.480
My Lord.

19:40.759 --> 19:42.640
Perhaps you don't know this,

19:43.279 --> 19:45.240
but Commander Zhao and I

19:45.480 --> 19:47.200
are like brothers.

19:47.559 --> 19:48.359
This matter...

19:49.559 --> 19:50.519
Is that so?

19:51.119 --> 19:53.319
Then why weren't you invited
to his victory banquet?

19:55.519 --> 19:57.160
Between officials and merchants,

19:57.920 --> 20:00.480
how could there ever be true friendship?

20:02.519 --> 20:03.799
The two of you

20:05.720 --> 20:08.440
have long been walking different paths.

20:16.079 --> 20:17.160
Don't worry.

20:18.279 --> 20:19.720
If this succeeds,

20:20.559 --> 20:21.640
Zhao Ling

20:21.720 --> 20:24.400
will at worst be demoted and sent away.

20:24.839 --> 20:25.880
But you...

20:26.039 --> 20:29.519
you'll gain real wealth
and tangible benefits.

20:32.160 --> 20:34.759
I heard there's a merchant
called Shopkeeper Ye.

20:34.759 --> 20:36.599
He's privately been

20:36.599 --> 20:37.640
complaining quite a lot to you.

20:48.079 --> 20:48.680
Mr. Jin.

20:49.039 --> 20:49.559
You wanted to see me?

20:50.720 --> 20:51.440
What did you call me?

20:51.440 --> 20:52.000
Mr. Jin.

20:54.079 --> 20:54.920
Call me brother.

20:55.599 --> 20:56.279
Bro Yuanbao.

20:56.559 --> 20:57.440
Remember this.

20:57.759 --> 20:59.720
I'll always be your Brother Yuanbao.

21:02.960 --> 21:04.079
I called you here today

21:04.079 --> 21:05.480
because I need your help with something.

21:06.079 --> 21:08.960
In a few days, it's Brother Yucheng's
memorial ceremony.

21:09.680 --> 21:11.000
I had

21:11.000 --> 21:12.319
a solid gold incense burner made.

21:12.519 --> 21:13.880
I don't trust anyone else to handle it.

21:14.160 --> 21:15.440
You're young and quick on your feet.

21:15.519 --> 21:16.599
Go to Yuzhou for me

21:16.599 --> 21:17.160
and bring it back.

21:17.599 --> 21:18.920
Solid gold?

21:19.640 --> 21:21.039
You're really willing
to spend that much?

21:23.039 --> 21:24.559
It's for Brother Yucheng.

21:25.240 --> 21:26.200
He's one of our own.

21:28.400 --> 21:29.279
Don't worry.

21:29.519 --> 21:30.559
I'll make it in time.

21:30.839 --> 21:32.119
Before the wedding,

21:32.119 --> 21:33.119
I'll definitely be back.

21:33.119 --> 21:33.480
Good.

21:33.880 --> 21:34.640
Leave it to me.

21:36.960 --> 21:38.680
I may have no parents,

21:38.759 --> 21:40.440
but luckily I have brothers like you.

21:41.160 --> 21:42.440
Every one of you treats me
better than the last.

21:48.400 --> 21:49.920
Mr. Zhao was asking about you
the other day.

21:50.799 --> 21:52.480
He said you hadn't stopped by
in a long time.

21:56.559 --> 21:57.279
I've been busy.

21:57.839 --> 21:58.799
The salt reform is about to begin.

21:58.799 --> 21:59.920
Things are still uncertain.

22:00.319 --> 22:01.480
I don't want to trouble Mr. Zhao.

22:01.720 --> 22:02.599
I'll be going then.

22:02.599 --> 22:03.039
Yuanbao.

22:03.039 --> 22:03.480
Go on.

22:05.119 --> 22:05.960
Take care.

22:10.599 --> 22:12.319
Honorable Magistrate,

22:12.799 --> 22:14.319
I, Jin Yuanbao, a humble commoner,

22:15.119 --> 22:15.880
hereby accuse

22:16.039 --> 22:17.880
Zhao Ling, General Zhaoyong,

22:18.119 --> 22:19.519
of colluding with merchants,

22:19.519 --> 22:20.839
engaging in illegal salt trading,

22:21.319 --> 22:22.240
and forcing salt merchants

22:22.400 --> 22:23.920
to pay him profits and bribes.

22:25.160 --> 22:25.839
All

22:26.079 --> 22:27.440
financial transactions

22:27.680 --> 22:29.039
property records and land deeds

22:29.119 --> 22:30.640
bear his personal seal!

22:32.680 --> 22:33.319
Your Majesty,

22:33.720 --> 22:35.640
Since the salt reform was implemented
on a trial basis in Anzhou,

22:35.640 --> 22:37.920
it has brought in an additional two
hundred thousand taels for the treasury.

22:38.359 --> 22:39.759
These are the reports

22:39.759 --> 22:41.200
and account records submitted
by the local officials,

22:41.200 --> 22:42.200
along with their reports of success.

22:44.840 --> 22:47.640
(Memorial: Report on the Success
of the New Salt Reform in Anzhou)

22:47.640 --> 22:50.360
(Report on Salt Official Zhao Ling's
Deception, Embezzlement and Bribery)

22:54.240 --> 22:55.560
(Report on Impeiral Salt Inspector
Shen Congsi's Death While in Office)

23:00.119 --> 23:01.359
Your handling of affairs,
Grand Secretary,

23:01.640 --> 23:03.160
has greatly pleased me.

23:06.400 --> 23:07.000
Your Majesty,

23:07.000 --> 23:08.640
I have another matter to report.

23:10.400 --> 23:11.599
A salt merchant has come forward

23:12.119 --> 23:13.279
to accuse Zhao Ling

23:13.920 --> 23:15.480
not only of colluding with merchants,

23:15.480 --> 23:16.759
but also of coercing them
into paying bribes.

23:16.759 --> 23:17.440
More than that,

23:18.279 --> 23:19.200
this man

23:19.440 --> 23:21.640
was once a salt smuggler.

23:23.720 --> 23:24.480
Yet

23:24.480 --> 23:25.720
he concealed his past,

23:25.720 --> 23:26.640
infiltrated the army,

23:26.640 --> 23:27.920
and deceived the throne.

23:28.480 --> 23:30.440
We now have

23:30.440 --> 23:31.920
land deeds and property records bearing
Zhao Ling's personal seal as evidence.

23:32.200 --> 23:33.559
Please examine them, Your Majesty.

23:39.000 --> 23:39.680
Your Majesty,

23:39.960 --> 23:40.960
a high-ranking official of the court

23:41.039 --> 23:42.400
has actually falsified his identity.

23:42.680 --> 23:44.720
This is a grave crime
of deceiving the throne.

23:45.119 --> 23:46.640
The question is, was he truly capable
of hiding this so well,

23:46.640 --> 23:47.839
that he deceived everyone,

23:47.960 --> 23:48.839
or

23:49.519 --> 23:50.319
did someone

23:50.319 --> 23:51.839
deliberately shield and enable him?

23:52.240 --> 23:53.720
I beg Your Majesty
to investigate thoroughly.

23:55.000 --> 23:55.640
Your Majesty,

23:55.920 --> 23:57.960
the new salt policy has only
been tested in Anzhou,

23:58.200 --> 23:59.880
yet it has already generated two hundred
thousand taels in revenue.

24:00.039 --> 24:01.240
If implemented nationwide,

24:01.240 --> 24:02.799
it could bring in millions.

24:03.039 --> 24:03.960
And yet now,

24:04.519 --> 24:05.680
the person in charge
of the salt administration

24:05.759 --> 24:08.440
is a former salt smuggler
who deceived the throne.

24:09.039 --> 24:10.799
How can the people trust such a policy?

24:10.799 --> 24:12.559
And how can this new salt reform

24:12.559 --> 24:13.559
be carried forward?

24:16.279 --> 24:17.000
Your Majesty,

24:18.119 --> 24:19.240
I believe

24:22.680 --> 24:24.400
the salt reform should be suspended

24:24.759 --> 24:26.039
and this case thoroughly investigated.

24:26.599 --> 24:27.480
A temporary loss of treasury revenue

24:27.759 --> 24:29.119
is a minor matter,

24:29.119 --> 24:30.079
but the integrity of the court

24:31.559 --> 24:32.799
must be upheld.

24:38.559 --> 24:40.039
The salt reform concerns
the foundation of the state.

24:40.279 --> 24:41.960
How can it be abandoned
because of one man?

24:42.480 --> 24:43.240
Issue my decree.

24:43.799 --> 24:44.960
The affairs of salt administration

24:44.960 --> 24:46.319
shall temporarily be placed
under the Ministry of Revenue.

24:46.759 --> 24:47.519
Zhao Ling

24:50.559 --> 24:51.960
is to be suspended from office
and imprisoned.

24:52.559 --> 24:53.359
Investigate!

24:53.519 --> 24:55.240
Conduct a full
and thorough investigation!

24:55.839 --> 24:57.599
Your Majesty, please reconsider.

25:08.240 --> 25:10.400
A wise decision, Your Majesty!

25:24.759 --> 25:25.279
Search!

25:25.279 --> 25:27.200
(Xie Residence)

25:31.320 --> 25:32.800
(Xie Residence)

25:34.640 --> 25:35.279
My Lord.

25:43.920 --> 25:44.759
I beg you, My Lord,

25:44.759 --> 25:45.559
to show us some mercy.

25:45.880 --> 25:47.119
The lady in this residence

25:47.119 --> 25:48.519
is an old acquaintance
of our young master.

25:49.119 --> 25:50.119
Please, My Lord,

25:50.839 --> 25:51.720
spare her some hardship.

25:52.440 --> 25:53.119
I cannot.

25:55.039 --> 25:55.880
Young Lord Yu,

25:56.400 --> 25:57.920
it is not that I refuse your kindness,

25:58.039 --> 25:58.720
but

25:59.319 --> 26:00.799
regarding the confiscation
of the Zhao estate,

26:01.240 --> 26:02.559
your father

26:02.640 --> 26:04.000
has already given us instructions
beforehand.

26:04.759 --> 26:06.079
As for this money you offer,

26:06.079 --> 26:06.920
I

26:07.759 --> 26:09.240
dare not accept it.

26:20.640 --> 26:21.119
Move!

26:22.079 --> 26:22.720
Stay down!

26:23.160 --> 26:24.000
Get down! Down!

26:24.599 --> 26:25.359
Get down now!

26:25.599 --> 26:26.359
Down!

26:31.319 --> 26:32.160
Madam,

26:32.440 --> 26:33.920
we've already sent word to Madam Wang.

26:33.920 --> 26:35.039
Why hasn't she arrived yet?

26:35.039 --> 26:35.519
Don't panic.

26:36.000 --> 26:37.359
Just stall them until they get here.

26:37.480 --> 26:38.799
At least we'll be safe for now.

26:38.799 --> 26:39.240
Down!

26:39.319 --> 26:39.880
Get down!

26:40.279 --> 26:41.000
Spare us!

26:41.000 --> 26:41.279
Come here.

26:41.559 --> 26:41.880
Sanniang!

26:41.880 --> 26:42.799
Parasites feeding off the court!

26:43.039 --> 26:44.759
Spare me the act of loyalty
between master and servant!

26:45.119 --> 26:46.759
Do you know the salt you consume
every day

26:47.319 --> 26:49.480
was bought with the Zhao couple's
dirty money?

26:49.480 --> 26:50.759
How dare you slander us!

26:50.920 --> 26:52.160
You haven't even investigated,

26:52.359 --> 26:53.839
yet you call us parasites!

26:53.839 --> 26:54.640
Our lady's

26:54.640 --> 26:56.000
family is the Xie family of Jiangnan.

26:56.000 --> 26:57.480
She has every right to her
own family assets!

26:57.480 --> 26:57.799
Exactly!

26:57.799 --> 26:58.480
That's right!

26:59.119 --> 27:00.359
This case has not yet been decided.

27:00.799 --> 27:02.160
We are merely cooperating
with the investigation,

27:02.279 --> 27:03.519
not convicted criminals.

27:03.799 --> 27:05.240
Since there is no imperial decree
declaring us guilty,

27:05.559 --> 27:07.279
you officers should stop
making things difficult for us.

27:07.440 --> 27:08.839
Even these clothes were bought
with the people's money.

27:08.839 --> 27:09.319
Take it off!

27:09.319 --> 27:10.119
What are you doing?

27:10.240 --> 27:11.279
What are you doing?

27:11.799 --> 27:13.039
Don't touch our lady!

27:13.440 --> 27:14.880
How can you be so cruel?

27:14.960 --> 27:16.480
You're trying to ruin
my young madam's reputation!

27:16.480 --> 27:17.440
How dare you!

27:18.119 --> 27:18.880
Sanniang!

27:18.880 --> 27:19.480
Madam!

27:19.960 --> 27:20.640
Stop!

27:24.759 --> 27:26.440
I advise you all to act according
to the law.

27:26.960 --> 27:29.039
If you intend to take advantage
of this situation and bully these women,

27:29.119 --> 27:30.319
you'll have to get through us first!

27:30.519 --> 27:31.920
Confiscating the estate is one thing.

27:32.119 --> 27:33.519
Did His Majesty ever decree

27:33.519 --> 27:34.920
that you could harass the women
of the household?

27:35.000 --> 27:36.119
Ransack and rob their home?

27:36.200 --> 27:37.079
Did he ever order you

27:37.079 --> 27:38.279
to strip women in public?

27:38.359 --> 27:40.160
Exactly!

27:40.160 --> 27:41.119
Who gave you the right?

27:41.359 --> 27:42.079
And you!

27:42.240 --> 27:43.119
If your mother

27:43.119 --> 27:44.319
knew what you've been doing out here,

27:44.319 --> 27:45.319
bullying women like this,

27:45.319 --> 27:46.799
she'd crawl out of her grave
to stop you.

27:46.799 --> 27:47.240
You...

27:47.240 --> 27:48.000
What!

27:48.079 --> 27:48.880
You all look like decent men,

27:48.880 --> 27:50.000
but you behave like animals,

27:50.079 --> 27:51.640
doing such filthy things.

27:51.640 --> 27:53.640
If you have the courage, go fight
the enemy at the frontier.

27:53.640 --> 27:54.559
Don't show off your power here.

27:54.559 --> 27:55.519
What kind of men are you?

27:55.599 --> 27:56.680
Exactly!

27:56.680 --> 27:58.039
What kind of men are you?

27:58.039 --> 27:58.599
Enough!

28:02.160 --> 28:03.680
Follow the proper procedure.

28:04.359 --> 28:05.240
Madam Zhao,

28:05.519 --> 28:06.400
remove your jewelry

28:06.640 --> 28:07.480
and come with us.

28:08.400 --> 28:09.400
The remaining servants

28:09.759 --> 28:10.759
will be detained according to the law

28:11.000 --> 28:11.799
pending further orders.

28:15.200 --> 28:15.880
Madam.

28:16.200 --> 28:16.880
It's alright.

28:16.880 --> 28:17.240
Let's go.

28:18.920 --> 28:19.519
Sanniang.

28:24.920 --> 28:25.559
Madam.

28:25.720 --> 28:26.440
Madam.

28:26.599 --> 28:27.119
Madam.

28:27.680 --> 28:28.480
Are you alright?

28:35.119 --> 28:36.559
Thank you, Madam,

28:37.119 --> 28:38.359
and all of you sisters,

28:38.640 --> 28:39.720
for coming to my aid in my darkest hour.

28:40.240 --> 28:41.920
Don't say that.

28:42.079 --> 28:42.920
No worries.

28:43.279 --> 28:44.559
Leave everything here to us.

28:52.200 --> 28:53.960
All of you are under temporary
contracts,

28:54.599 --> 28:56.079
so you should not have been dragged
into this.

28:57.680 --> 28:58.920
The trouble we face today

29:00.960 --> 29:02.279
was caused by Mr. Zhao and me,

29:02.720 --> 29:03.839
and we have put you all
in this position.

29:04.880 --> 29:06.200
But rest assured,

29:06.960 --> 29:08.400
as long as no verdict has been issued,

29:09.119 --> 29:11.240
no one can sell you off at will.

29:12.680 --> 29:13.480
For now,

29:14.759 --> 29:16.359
you may have to endure some hardship,

29:18.400 --> 29:20.160
but when the truth comes to light,

29:20.720 --> 29:21.839
you will all receive

29:21.839 --> 29:22.880
the justice you deserve.

29:22.880 --> 29:24.279
Madam, please don't say that.

29:24.640 --> 29:25.640
For all these years,

29:26.400 --> 29:28.319
we have followed you and Mr. Zhao,

29:28.720 --> 29:30.720
and you have treated us like family.

29:31.160 --> 29:33.440
You have never spoken a harsh word
to us.

29:33.799 --> 29:34.920
Our monthly wages

29:35.079 --> 29:36.920
have never been short by even a penny.

29:36.920 --> 29:38.640
Today, I failed you.

29:39.279 --> 29:40.799
I could not share your burdens

29:41.319 --> 29:42.759
or clear your name.

29:42.920 --> 29:45.279
But we will never betray you!

29:45.279 --> 29:46.319
We will wait for you to return!

29:46.319 --> 29:47.200
We won't leave!

29:47.200 --> 29:47.559
Yes!

29:47.839 --> 29:48.559
That's right, Madam.

29:48.559 --> 29:49.000
Yes!

29:49.000 --> 29:49.559
Madam.

29:49.559 --> 29:50.880
We'll wait for you and Mr. Zhao

29:51.440 --> 29:52.640
to have your names cleared

29:52.799 --> 29:53.720
and return safely.

29:53.720 --> 29:54.880
We'll wait for you!

29:54.880 --> 29:55.799
We await your return!

29:55.799 --> 29:57.000
We'll wait for you!

30:03.400 --> 30:05.760
(Xie Residence)

30:13.079 --> 30:13.880
It has begun to snow.

30:13.880 --> 30:14.920
It's snowing.

30:18.079 --> 30:18.960
There must be an injustice here.

30:18.960 --> 30:19.720
Indeed.

30:41.200 --> 30:43.800
(Sealed by the Northern Bureau
of the Imperial Guard)

30:47.359 --> 30:48.160
Mr. Zhao.

30:49.039 --> 30:50.480
Someone asked me to inform you that

30:50.480 --> 30:52.039
your wife has also been taken
into custody.

31:12.960 --> 31:13.799
The offerings,

31:13.799 --> 31:14.559
spirit money,

31:14.559 --> 31:16.160
and Yucheng's favorite
Pear Blossom White wine...

31:16.599 --> 31:17.000
Everything is ready.

31:17.640 --> 31:18.039
Look.

31:18.039 --> 31:19.319
Why has it been sealed?

31:19.680 --> 31:20.960
Don't look. Let's go.

31:27.120 --> 31:30.400
(Xie Residence)

31:44.559 --> 31:45.200
Madam.

31:45.200 --> 31:45.920
Sen is here.

31:47.400 --> 31:47.920
Madam.

31:48.599 --> 31:49.720
What exactly happened?

31:50.559 --> 31:52.799
It was Jin Yuanbao. He submitted
a memorial to the court,

31:53.160 --> 31:54.759
accusing Zhao Ling
of three major crimes.

31:55.160 --> 31:55.960
First,

31:56.480 --> 31:58.680
colluding with Chief Merchant Ye
to sell illicit salt.

31:58.759 --> 31:59.519
Second,

32:00.079 --> 32:01.920
forcing salt merchants to hand
over half of their profits

32:01.920 --> 32:02.799
as so-called "tea money."

32:02.960 --> 32:03.799
Third,

32:06.400 --> 32:07.880
he dug up Zhao Ling's past before
he joined the army,

32:07.880 --> 32:09.279
claiming that he had once dealt
in illicit salt.

32:09.559 --> 32:11.279
He also presented

32:11.279 --> 32:12.720
land deeds bearing Zhao Ling's
private seal as evidence.

32:13.000 --> 32:14.920
With truth and lies mixed together,

32:14.920 --> 32:15.920
it will be difficult to refute.

32:15.920 --> 32:16.559
Impossible!

32:17.119 --> 32:18.839
Brother Yuanbao was the one
who sent me to Yuzhou

32:19.279 --> 32:20.680
to pick up the offerings
for Brother Yucheng's memorial rite.

32:20.680 --> 32:21.839
That's why I left the capital.

32:22.640 --> 32:24.279
How could he betray Mr. Zhao?

32:25.119 --> 32:25.799
Sen.

32:27.920 --> 32:29.079
People change.

32:38.039 --> 32:39.079
This staff

32:39.079 --> 32:40.960
was repaired for you
by Commander Zhao himself.

32:41.799 --> 32:43.559
He originally planned to give it to you

32:43.559 --> 32:44.240
at your wedding.

32:44.440 --> 32:46.480
But sadly, he is now behind bars.

32:47.720 --> 32:48.720
You should keep it

32:50.440 --> 32:51.759
for now.

33:13.359 --> 33:14.000
Madam.

33:14.319 --> 33:15.559
Can you save Mr. Zhao?

33:17.200 --> 33:18.960
I will repay your kindness
for the rest of my life.

33:20.680 --> 33:21.319
Get up.

33:25.240 --> 33:27.279
Our lord is doing everything he can
to help him.

33:27.799 --> 33:28.640
If the worst comes to pass,

33:29.319 --> 33:30.880
the Wang family will do everything
in our power to protect you.

33:31.799 --> 33:33.240
Your marriage

33:33.440 --> 33:34.519
will not be affected.

33:42.359 --> 33:43.599
How did it come to this?

34:12.000 --> 34:12.480
Yu...

34:13.280 --> 34:13.800
Yu...

34:17.280 --> 34:18.199
Mr. Jin.

34:18.440 --> 34:19.440
Sorry to keep you waiting.

34:20.880 --> 34:21.679
Where is the Grand Secretary?

34:23.239 --> 34:23.920
Where is he?

34:24.159 --> 34:25.559
My Lord is tied up
with official matters.

34:25.880 --> 34:27.519
He simply cannot spare the time.

34:27.880 --> 34:28.880
Whatever you need,

34:29.039 --> 34:30.320
you may tell me instead.

34:35.000 --> 34:36.480
I came here because

34:36.960 --> 34:38.440
of the Zhao family's situation.

34:39.000 --> 34:40.440
The Grand Secretary promised me

34:40.519 --> 34:41.360
at most,

34:41.559 --> 34:42.320
it would only be

34:42.480 --> 34:43.840
exile to the border.

34:43.840 --> 34:45.679
How did it end up becoming

34:46.039 --> 34:48.119
imprisonment and confiscation
of his entire estate?

34:50.559 --> 34:51.599
Some things

34:52.519 --> 34:53.679
are like this tea.

34:55.000 --> 34:56.400
Once swallowed,

34:56.800 --> 34:58.119
can it ever be brought back up?

35:05.280 --> 35:06.360
Mr. Jin.

35:08.320 --> 35:09.599
The tea has gone cold.

35:34.760 --> 35:35.480
My Lord.

35:53.559 --> 35:54.559
Sen is here.

36:01.159 --> 36:02.280
Yucheng's offerings...

36:02.360 --> 36:03.599
For the memorial rite, are all prepared?

36:06.800 --> 36:07.960
Why did you lie to me?

36:08.599 --> 36:09.480
What did I lie to you about?

36:09.480 --> 36:10.880
You deliberately sent me to Yuzhou.

36:11.480 --> 36:12.159
Tell me!

36:12.480 --> 36:13.880
Why did you betray Mr. Zhao?

36:14.159 --> 36:15.320
What are you talking about?
Betray Mr. Zhao?

36:15.320 --> 36:16.400
Who filled your head with that nonsense?

36:16.400 --> 36:17.400
I'm not a child anymore!

36:17.400 --> 36:18.480
I'm eighteen now!

36:19.360 --> 36:21.079
Why do you always keep me in the dark

36:21.079 --> 36:21.960
whenever something happens to you?

36:21.960 --> 36:22.760
Why?

36:29.800 --> 36:32.159
Mr. Zhao stood in the way
of too many people.

36:32.400 --> 36:34.239
Even if I hadn't reported him,

36:34.719 --> 36:36.639
someone else would have.

36:37.199 --> 36:38.840
If someone else can claim this fortune,

36:39.840 --> 36:41.639
why can't it be mine?

36:43.519 --> 36:45.280
So it was money after all.

36:45.719 --> 36:47.039
What else is there to live for?

36:48.639 --> 36:50.400
If not for money, then what?

36:59.920 --> 37:01.320
If you had ever had to rely on yourself

37:01.320 --> 37:02.800
to survive even a single day
in this world,

37:02.800 --> 37:04.000
you would never ask such a question!

37:13.559 --> 37:15.599
Ever since Mr. Zhao came to the capital,

37:15.920 --> 37:18.079
has he ever truly treated me,
Jin Yuanbao, like a brother?

37:18.320 --> 37:20.440
He humiliated me in front
of his own men.

37:20.440 --> 37:20.719
He...

37:20.719 --> 37:21.800
Sen, what are you doing?

37:21.800 --> 37:22.679
Withdraw the complaint!

37:26.920 --> 37:29.599
I went to see Grand Secretary Yu.

37:31.440 --> 37:33.559
But he refused to see me.

37:34.559 --> 37:35.920
When I was useful,

37:36.840 --> 37:37.960
they treated me like I mattered.

37:38.400 --> 37:39.639
But when they no longer needed me,

37:39.639 --> 37:41.480
who ever saw me as a person?

37:43.920 --> 37:46.840
Every single one of them is the same.

37:48.039 --> 37:49.519
Sen, open your eyes and see clearly.

37:51.840 --> 37:53.559
People prey on each other.

37:53.840 --> 37:55.760
That's the world we live in!

38:06.400 --> 38:07.840
I sent you to Yuzhou

38:09.960 --> 38:12.360
because I still cared
about our brotherhood.

38:13.199 --> 38:14.719
If it weren't for me, Jin Yuanbao,

38:15.280 --> 38:17.639
you'd be rotting in prison
with Mr. Zhao right now.

38:27.360 --> 38:28.639
Ever since we were kids,

38:30.000 --> 38:32.000
you all made me train
with a staff instead of a blade.

38:32.000 --> 38:33.280
You said it was because you didn't
want me to get blood on my hands.

38:34.000 --> 38:35.280
So I only trained with a staff.

38:36.119 --> 38:37.199
But even a staff...

38:40.000 --> 38:42.039
can still kill.

39:03.679 --> 39:07.440
I've already done everything I could,
in good conscience!

39:07.559 --> 39:10.400
You can't ask anything more of me!

39:12.719 --> 39:13.639
Brother Yuanbao.

39:15.719 --> 39:16.880
I truly thought

39:19.519 --> 39:21.440
we'd be brothers for life.

39:50.559 --> 39:51.320
Sen.

39:53.679 --> 39:54.320
Sen.

39:55.079 --> 39:55.800
Sen.

39:58.440 --> 39:59.039
Let me see.

40:01.559 --> 40:02.360
Thank goodness.

40:03.039 --> 40:04.480
Thank goodness you didn't
do anything foolish.

40:12.039 --> 40:14.760
Mr. Zhao found me between three trees.

40:16.760 --> 40:17.920
Brother Yuanbao said,

40:18.599 --> 40:19.760
"Let's call him Sen."

40:22.039 --> 40:24.239
Mr. Zhao wasn't the only one
who raised me.

40:27.079 --> 40:27.920
They said

40:28.840 --> 40:30.119
that after I came into their lives,

40:31.400 --> 40:33.159
the brothers became less ruthless.

40:35.079 --> 40:36.480
Even though they dealt in illicit salt,

40:37.320 --> 40:38.840
they never became mere thugs.

41:07.480 --> 41:09.679
Jin Yuanbao...

41:10.000 --> 41:11.599
If back then,

41:13.400 --> 41:14.119
you had accepted your place,

41:15.719 --> 41:17.280
and simply stayed

41:18.360 --> 41:20.000
in Huaying,

41:20.800 --> 41:23.079
as a shopkeeper,

41:28.119 --> 41:30.400
you wouldn't have ended up
like this today...

41:30.679 --> 41:32.639
losing an ear,

41:34.360 --> 41:36.559
losing a whole group of brothers,

41:37.119 --> 41:38.320
and now,

41:40.400 --> 41:41.480
you still have to

41:42.159 --> 41:44.679
fight for this wretched life of yours.

42:03.360 --> 42:04.679
Grand Secretary Yu

42:05.280 --> 42:06.639
was right.

42:09.360 --> 42:11.039
In this world,

42:12.639 --> 42:14.639
you either devour others,

42:15.960 --> 42:16.719
or...

42:17.920 --> 42:20.000
you let yourself be devoured.

42:21.400 --> 42:22.000
I...

42:24.239 --> 42:26.599
I did nothing wrong.

42:45.079 --> 42:46.719
Please, do me this favor.

42:47.039 --> 42:48.360
Just give you the time it takes
for one incense stick to burn.

42:48.440 --> 42:49.039
Make it quick.

42:52.239 --> 42:53.000
Madam Zhao!

42:59.039 --> 43:00.079
Sister, I must say,

43:00.239 --> 43:01.480
you're surprisingly generous today.

43:01.599 --> 43:03.599
You've fallen into such a predicament,

43:03.800 --> 43:05.760
yet you still have the heart
to joke around?

43:08.480 --> 43:09.480
It's nothing.

43:10.480 --> 43:12.440
I've survived worse than this.

43:13.199 --> 43:14.320
Why would I fear this?

43:17.440 --> 43:18.159
These

43:18.320 --> 43:19.360
are from Madam Wang.

43:19.360 --> 43:21.559
She sent clothes and money for you.

43:21.559 --> 43:22.920
She specifically asked us to tell you

43:22.920 --> 43:24.480
that she will take good care of Sen.

43:25.199 --> 43:25.760
She wants you to

43:26.079 --> 43:27.400
take care of yourself.

43:28.920 --> 43:29.880
Listen to me.

43:30.000 --> 43:30.960
If it comes down to it,

43:30.960 --> 43:31.760
put everything

43:31.760 --> 43:33.239
on Commander Zhao.

43:33.840 --> 43:34.719
He loves you so much.

43:34.719 --> 43:35.679
He would never blame you.

43:36.480 --> 43:37.519
As women,

43:37.519 --> 43:38.639
no matter what happens,

43:38.639 --> 43:39.920
we can never give up on ourselves.

43:40.320 --> 43:42.079
You have to survive.

43:45.840 --> 43:47.119
He cares for me.

43:48.159 --> 43:49.800
Then I have to care for him too.

43:55.079 --> 43:56.480
Don't worry, sisters.

43:57.440 --> 43:58.599
I know what I'm doing.

44:00.599 --> 44:02.800
What a miserable place this is.

44:03.159 --> 44:05.400
It's not even as good as Gannin.

44:06.239 --> 44:09.039
If only we were all still in Gannin.

44:09.039 --> 44:10.679
General Mo wouldn't have died.

44:11.360 --> 44:13.280
General Zhao's estate wouldn't
have been confiscated.

44:13.840 --> 44:15.719
Nothing would have changed.

44:19.480 --> 44:20.239
Yes.

44:23.599 --> 44:24.719
But in this world,

44:26.840 --> 44:28.280
there's no going back.

44:33.320 --> 44:35.840
(Next Episode)

44:36.199 --> 44:37.360
Mr. Zhao...

44:38.280 --> 44:39.239
He's gone.

44:40.559 --> 44:41.159
She...

44:42.719 --> 44:43.639
She's really all right?

44:44.559 --> 44:46.639
Some people fight their way up,

44:46.719 --> 44:47.679
while others

44:47.679 --> 44:49.480
fear being replaced.

44:50.239 --> 44:51.679
What matters most right now

44:51.760 --> 44:52.920
is that we find out

44:52.920 --> 44:55.239
what Zhao Ling has really been up to.

44:55.760 --> 44:57.760
If you try to stir up more trouble,

44:58.159 --> 45:00.079
I'm afraid the final outcome

45:02.119 --> 45:05.159
will be far worse than just drinking
this bowl of chastity soup.

45:17.921 --> 45:22.241
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

45:25.841 --> 45:30.201
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

45:32.321 --> 45:36.961
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

45:37.201 --> 45:40.001
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

45:41.161 --> 45:45.801
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

45:49.001 --> 45:55.841
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill
my eyes with tears♪

45:56.721 --> 46:03.241
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

46:04.201 --> 46:07.641
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

46:08.161 --> 46:12.361
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

46:12.641 --> 46:18.321
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

46:30.441 --> 46:34.321
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you
in the crowd♪

46:38.241 --> 46:42.241
♪Without a word, you lit up
half my life♪

46:43.961 --> 46:48.641
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

46:48.961 --> 46:51.641
♪Kept close within my heart♪

46:52.721 --> 46:57.561
♪From now on, no one else
is worth waiting for♪

47:01.081 --> 47:08.001
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

47:08.881 --> 47:15.361
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

47:16.241 --> 47:19.761
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

47:20.201 --> 47:24.561
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

47:24.761 --> 47:30.481
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪
